# Phase identity: PyRITE crystal catalog entry [v2o5].
# Bundled full-basis P1 CIF used by the declarative material catalog.
# Catalog provenance and assumptions:
# Alpha-V2O5, ambient orthorhombic standard Pmmn (two formula units per cell).
# a=11.512, b=3.564, c=4.368 A: McColl, Johnson & Cora, PCCP 20, 15002
# (2018), doi:10.1039/C8CP02187B. Four unique-site coordinates are from
# Sipr et al., Phys. Rev. B 60, 14115 (1999), doi:10.1103/PhysRevB.60.14115.
# This P1 representation lists the 4f and 2a sites explicitly.
# Assumes stoichiometric ambient alpha-V2O5. The historical Pmnm (010) layered
# cut is standard-Pmmn (001). Limiting checks: V=a*b*c, 4V+10O, and finite
# F/chi/U for that normal (001) reflection.
# Validation: v2o5-010-structure
